# Kellan Joins Up: "you may exile a nonland card with mana value 3 or less from your hand. If you do, it becomes plotted."
# The limit is met exactly: Centaur Courser (mana value 3) may be chosen, and "a nonland card" is one - choosing it and the
# Lightning Bolt (mana value 1) together is refused. The Courser is exiled and plotted, and on turn 3 Bot1 casts it from
# exile without paying its mana cost, the Bolt still in hand.

